Z||000000||stimpy||08-06-2000||10:07 PM||||Came home and had an invite on my doorstep to participate in a caravan to Vernon Texas for the "Southern Nationals Cruise Weekend". Members of the Fiero Club of Oklahoma are meeting at the Braum's at I-44 & Newcastle Road to head down, leaving at 9 am "sharp" on Saturday, August 12. Of course,any non members are welcome to join us, or join in on the caravan as we head south for Texas. Would also love to meet up with Texas Fiero folks. Apparently this will be quite a blowout, with about 1500 cruisers of all types showing up. Let's go represent Fiero!<BR><P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://gifs123.tripod.com/page15/renstimpy2.gif"> ||||reg||14
